Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:06.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么一个天使要救我出地狱呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why would an angel rescue me from hell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.43,0:00:08.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们有任务交给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we have work for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.10,0:00:14.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要学的东西还多着呢  兔崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a lot to learn,boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.33,0:00:16.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是真的吗  是我打破了第一道封印吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true? Did I break the first seal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:18.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都是我造成的对吗  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I start all this? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你们不干脆把我留在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you just leave me there,then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:23.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开启这一切的正义之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The righteous man who begins it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.74,0:00:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是唯一能终结这一切的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the only one who can finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.08,0:00:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须阻止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.51,0:00:31.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的命运由你决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our fate rests with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.02,0:00:32.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找别人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.19,0:00:36.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是你说的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.30,0:00:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,'Cause he gets up in the morning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.27,0:00:49.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And he goes to work at 9
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.24,0:00:53.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And he comes back home at 5:30
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.27,0:00:55.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Gets the same train every time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.97,0:00:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,'Cause his world is built 'round punctuality
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:01.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,It never fails
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And he's oh so good
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:06.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And he's oh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:12.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,公共关系早间咨询\N{\fnArial\fs30}PR morning edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.25,0:01:14.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本周正是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for this week...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.46,0:01:18.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He's a well-respected man about town
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.46,0:01:23.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Doing the best things so conservatively
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:26.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And he likes his own backyard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.64,0:01:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And he likes his fags the best
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.37,0:01:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,'Cause he's better than the rest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.31,0:01:35.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And his own sweat smells the best
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.38,0:01:36.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And he hopes to grab his father's loot
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.86,0:01:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩·斯密斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}市场营销部经理
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:41.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,When pater passes on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.05,0:01:44.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,'Cause he's oh so good
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,And he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.16,0:01:47.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I want to know is,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.63,0:01:49.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们什么时候才会有另一个像"天桥骄子"这样的真人秀节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are they gonna have another show like "Project Runway"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.10,0:01:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,...And his mind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.26,0:01:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He's a well-respected man about town
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.50,0:01:58.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Doing the best things so...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:01:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暂时不说网络收益的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Net profitability aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.81,0:02:02.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我关心的是客户数量的增长率\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the client-retention rate that concerns me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:03.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对面销售利润的最大值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vis-a-Vis maximizing return on sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.98,0:02:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看过数据表之后给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buzz me back once you've seen the spreadsheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.41,0:02:08.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-艾德勒先生  -迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr. Adler. - Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.21,0:02:10.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-干得好  -干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good stuff. - Good stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:11.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大赚一票哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.78,0:02:14.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-干得好  -干得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good stuff. -Good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.12,0:02:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听到你说的了  我很久没去健身房了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,I hear you. I haven't been to the gym in ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:17.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己有点得意扬扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carrying a little bloat around myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.19,0:02:21.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  这是一成不变的生活作风  我的朋友  独一无二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,it's a sedentary lifestyle,my man. No two ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:23.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  再给我说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, tell me one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.90,0:02:27.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说  嗯  柠檬和...和什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said,uh,lemon and -- what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.43,0:02:29.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辣椒和枫树糖浆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cayenne and maple syrup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.43,0:02:30.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.47,0:02:32.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你损失了多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much did you lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.20,0:02:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,He's a well-respected man about town
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.37,0:02:39.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Doing the best things so conservatively
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.26,0:02:57.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们认识吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:02:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该不认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.40,0:03:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  哥们儿  你看着真眼熟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry,man. You just look really familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.44,0:03:10.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这话留着去健身室说去吧  你个小同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save it for the health club, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:23.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第4季第17集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:42.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,技术支持部  这是萨姆·威森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tech support. This is Sam Wesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.61,0:03:47.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你试着关机之后再开机了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Uh,well,did you try turning it off and then on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.15,0:03:49.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  直接关机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,go ahead and turn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.45,0:03:51.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不...  就...就直接关机\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no,no. just -- just off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.82,0:03:53.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  现在等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,give it a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:55.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.09,0:03:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  它是...是不是开始打印了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,is it -- is it printing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.22,0:03:59.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得小秘怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think of,uh,Mimi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.70,0:04:09.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:11.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许有机会搞上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might have to hit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.17,0:04:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们儿  你们年纪也差太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,dude,that's totally age-inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:14.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.77,0:04:16.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老花镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh,trifocals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可是御姐来着  萨姆  我知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a milf there,Sam. I just know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是御奶奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe a gmilf.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.61,0:04:21.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:22.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咖啡小憩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee break?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.61,0:04:24.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.79,0:04:28.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保罗  是时候补充能量了  哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul, time for a refuel,buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:30.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  没时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. No time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:32.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候开始的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:34.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们儿  我们是算时薪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,we get paid by the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:35.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.76,0:04:37.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他看起来压力挺大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:40.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许只是有点反常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably just freaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.03,0:04:42.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他上网浏览色情图片被降职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause he got busted surfing porn on the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.03,0:04:43.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不  等一下  什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no. Wait. When?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他昨天被人力资源叫走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He got sent up to h.r. yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.31,0:04:49.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,估计他们把他吓破胆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess they put the fear of god in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:01.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊恩  哥们儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian! Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.72,0:05:04.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是购购物  家里的刚用完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just doing a little shopping. Running low at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.59,0:05:07.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  萨姆...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:09.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最近还做那些梦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had any of those dreams lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.63,0:05:12.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  别那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Don't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.51,0:05:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  这是我一天最期待的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. It's the highlight of my day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:16.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一开始就不该告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never should have told you in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.11,0:05:17.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的梦棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:20.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说吧  哥们儿  和同学们一起分享下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hold out on me,dude. Share with the class.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.85,0:05:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定会嘲笑我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna be a dick about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.14,0:05:23.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？！ 绝对不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.59,0:05:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不会嘲笑你的  放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't say a word -- total respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:28.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.35,0:05:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我梦见我从恶魔手里救了一个叫泰莎的死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I dreamt that I saved a grim reaper named Tessa from demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.37,0:05:40.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太经典了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classic!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.99,0:05:43.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你小时候玩过多少次龙与地下城\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much d&d did youou play when you were a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:45.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦  天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,my.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:48.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你救了一个死神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,so you're rescuing the grim reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.05,0:05:50.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个大英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.19,0:05:52.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地我们这里也有哈利波特了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,thank god we got Harry Potter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.77,0:05:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拯救我们远离天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}To save us all from the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:56.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.29,0:05:57.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆·维森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam Wesson
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.46,0:07:10.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能问你个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.89,0:07:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们儿  我可不是个基佬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,man,I told you, I'm not into the --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.83,0:07:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  我也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,dude,come on. I'm not either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.15,0:07:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想问你个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to ask you one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.25,0:07:18.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:25.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得世界上有鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think about ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.68,0:07:28.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你相信有鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe in them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.61,0:07:36.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  我还真没怎么想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh,tell you the truth,I've never given it much thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.19,0:07:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那吸血鬼呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.07,0:07:38.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.28,0:07:40.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么问这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.33,0:07:46.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我最近做了一些很奇怪的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause i've been having some...weird dreams lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.69,0:07:48.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不太明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.79,0:07:57.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从来没有做过奇怪的梦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... You've never had any...weird dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:07:58.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,look,man, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:01.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不认识你  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know you,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.63,0:08:03.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我要告诉你些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm gonna do a public service
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.47,0:08:08.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你话太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And,uh,let you know that -- that you over-share.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:21.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你试过关上开关再打开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you turn it off,then on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.62,0:08:23.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well,let's try that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  没事  我等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,it's fine. i'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.37,0:08:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在打印了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it printing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.10,0:08:38.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:40.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时为您效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.24,0:08:44.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在干嘛呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatcha doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.64,0:08:46.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.85,0:08:49.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人力资源部给你发电邮了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get an e-mail from human resources?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.65,0:08:51.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有啊  为什么这么问\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.56,0:08:54.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠  难道只有我收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. guess it's just me,then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:58.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们让我  到人力资源部报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm supposed to,quote, "report to H.R.," unquote.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.09,0:08:59.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没准他们发现你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,they're probably finally busting you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:01.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把办公用品都偷光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For snaking all those office supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.63,0:09:04.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望只是打屁股而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope they spank me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.17,0:09:13.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no,no,no,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.37,0:09:14.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.61,0:09:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样对我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this to me. please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.48,0:09:19.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,man. you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死机了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It froze.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:23.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保罗  这种垃圾配置  死机很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're crap,Paul. they freeze all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:24.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't understand. when -- when
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.93,0:09:25.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我重启了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rebooted, ever
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:27.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是一整天的心血都白费了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole day's work -- deleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.15,0:09:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你备份了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,did you back up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.39,0:09:30.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,i didn't back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.56,0:09:33.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多希望我备份了  但是我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to god I backed up, but I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.33,0:09:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要找回来  我会找到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it back. I'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.69,0:09:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定就在什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.73,0:09:37.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.13,0:09:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保罗  没事的  这很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul,it's okay,man. these things happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.27,0:09:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.74,0:09:51.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.14,0:09:55.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.08,0:10:01.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.86,0:10:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有文件都  不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that work... Gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.90,0:10:12.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.09,0:11:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要加热鱼  很臭  谢谢合作
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.01,0:11:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些事好像不太对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something seem not right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  整件事都不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh,yeah. Try the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.98,0:11:31.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you,man...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.95,0:11:34.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不会吃爆米花了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never eat popcorn again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:38.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.65,0:11:42.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桑多弗公司个人档案\N员工姓名  保罗·邓巴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.06,0:11:48.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特别提示时间   09年4月14日  2周后\N请公司职员参加退休聚会  要通知所有的高级职员和主管经理
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.57,0:11:51.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有两周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:54.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,why would someone kill themselves
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.77,0:11:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在退休前两周自杀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two weeks before they were supposed to retire?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.11,0:12:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  保罗再过两周就自由了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,Paul was two weeks from freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.45,0:12:05.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他应该很开心才对  是不\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should have been... happy,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.52,0:12:07.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没时间说这个  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have time for this,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真搞笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:16.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在工作  很重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm working. it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:22.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人力资源部教训你了还是怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}H.r. bust your balls or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.70,0:12:24.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你穿着工作服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wearing the shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.20,0:12:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刮胡子了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you shave?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.14,0:12:31.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,技术支持部  我是伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tech support. this is Ian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:33.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.31,0:12:38.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得去22楼  找主管谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go up to 22, speak to a manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:50.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊恩  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. "Ian," is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:52.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. yeah,come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:54.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天你填写了445号工作表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, you filled out a 445-t.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.80,0:12:57.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有大问题  但有几处小错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And,uh,no problem -- just a -- just a few errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:12:59.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我们刚换成Vista系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,we did just switch over to vista,so i'm sure
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:01.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你习惯于填写只读光盘表吧  对不\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're used to filling out the dash-r's,am i right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.97,0:13:02.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.81,0:13:03.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  没关系  没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no. it's fine. it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.83,0:13:05.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想要你今天重新做一份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need you to redo one today
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.94,0:13:07.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我开完发票就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So i can get the show on the road with the invoicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.74,0:13:09.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的  就是重做一份  时间很充足\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,it's fine. just re-file it, and we're square.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.42,0:13:12.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信我居然做错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe i did this. i can't --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:15.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信  真不敢相信我居然做错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it. i...can't believe i did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.89,0:13:17.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,guy,come on --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.05,0:13:18.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:20.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它影响利润了  我搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It affected profits. it -- i screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.89,0:13:23.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我不敢相信  不敢相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I can't -- I can't --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.19,0:13:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.63,0:13:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could i do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:29.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对不起桑多弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I failed Sandover.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.53,0:13:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对不起公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}I failed the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊恩 你先坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh,why don't you sit down,Ian?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:35.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊恩  伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian. Ian!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:41.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian,hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静下  伙计  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just chill out,man. okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.26,0:13:59.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是出去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-hey,maybe we should get out of here,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.56,0:14:00.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:01.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.34,0:14:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来人帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.77,0:14:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我跟着他进了洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I,uh,i-i followed him into the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.87,0:14:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was,uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.28,0:14:48.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就站在镜子前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was standing there in front of the mirror,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.41,0:14:50.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.59,0:14:57.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把铅笔刺进了自己的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and,uh,he stabbed himself in the neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.59,0:14:59.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. that's,uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.97,0:15:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,技术支持部， 你好 我是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tech support. this is sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:14.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上来我办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see you in my office -- now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:22.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快进来 把门关上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in. shut the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.38,0:15:30.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure i know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:35.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:41.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫萨姆韦森  我三星期前才来上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam wesson. i started here three weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.07,0:15:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.63,0:15:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在电梯里把我叫住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cornered me in the elevator,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.87,0:15:50.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谈论鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talking about ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.37,0:15:52.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.94,0:15:56.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.88,0:16:00.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.05,0:16:01.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I,uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.68,0:16:04.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是三星期前来的公司  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,you started working here three weeks ago,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.29,0:16:07.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.43,0:16:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是超纯水\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's,uh, master cleanse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.59,0:16:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喝过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tried it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子大家都不喜欢做健康疗程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phenomenal. detoxes you like nobody's business.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.47,0:16:22.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你和伊恩在洗手间的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you were in that bathroom with ian...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.61,0:16:24.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有看到什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.91,0:16:28.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我看到的是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. i don't know what i saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:30.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你是说你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. are you saying that --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.75,0:16:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看见鬼魂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you...see a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:36.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时吓傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:37.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那人把铅笔插进自己的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy penciled his damn neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.92,0:16:39.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有看到  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did,didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:41.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,listen --
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.09,0:16:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会这些自杀其实并不是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if these suicides... aren't suicides?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.36,0:16:45.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  如果有些什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, w-what if there's something...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.39,0:16:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非自然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not natural?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道真的有鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what -- ghosts are real?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且它们要对这些命案负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're responsible for all the dead bodies around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:55.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是想说这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you're telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.61,0:16:57.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.74,0:16:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这有点疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it sounds crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.84,0:17:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  的确就是我想说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But yes -- that's what i'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.71,0:17:04.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的根据是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh. based on what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.52,0:17:10.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instinct?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.09,0:17:17.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got the same instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.46,0:17:18.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.69,0:17:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得我跟你说的那些梦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know those dreams i was telling you about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.10,0:17:23.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我梦到了鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was dreaming about ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.07,0:17:25.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是吗  -这些鬼魂出现在现实生活中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}-Yeah? -And then it turns out that there's a real ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.00,0:17:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是想说你的梦能预见未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're telling me that your dreams are special visions
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.37,0:17:30.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟那种通灵的人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're some kind of psychic?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:34.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不是  那太神经了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. i mean that would be nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.10,0:17:35.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-i'm just saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.54,0:17:38.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里确实发生了一些怪事  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something weird is definitely going on around here,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.34,0:17:40.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我做了些调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}So i've been digging around a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.34,0:17:42.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我找到了这两个人的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think i found a connection between the two guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:50.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你盗了他们的邮箱帐号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke into their e-mail accounts?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.19,0:17:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是用了些非常手段\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used...some skills that i happen to have
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.89,0:17:57.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来满足我的好奇心\N{\fnArial\fs30}To... satisfy my curiosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.56,0:17:59.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:01.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.40,0:18:04.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊恩和保罗都曾收到相同的电子邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,it turns out ian and paul both got this same e-mail
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.50,0:18:07.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要他们到1444房间的人力资源部报到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Telling them to report to h.r.,room 1444.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:09.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人力资源部在7楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}HR's on 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.07,0:18:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.54,0:18:15.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要不要去查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we go check this out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.98,0:18:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like...right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.65,0:18:23.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  有点太晚了  你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. no,it's getting late. you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:30.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就想去一探究竟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am dying to check this out right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:31.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:54.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.89,0:19:01.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:54.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.68,0:20:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道该那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you know how to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.21,0:20:32.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.00,0:20:42.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才真险 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap,dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.23,0:20:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.70,0:20:45.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想喝点啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.47,0:20:47.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  我在做健康疗程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,sorry,man. i'm on the cleanse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.30,0:20:49.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把所有不健康的东西都扔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got rid of all the carbs in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.94,0:20:52.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,how the hell did you know
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些鬼魂害怕扳手\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ghosts are scared of wrenches?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.11,0:20:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很疯狂 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.71,0:20:58.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你踢的那一脚也不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And nice job kicking in that door,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.88,0:21:00.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很像李连杰\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was very jet li.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.15,0:21:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是黑带还是什么级别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you -- like, a black belt or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:03.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.69,0:21:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本不知道我干嘛要那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no clue how i did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:10.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像我们之前就干过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like... we've done this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.93,0:21:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说之前是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, "before"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.70,0:21:14.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像莎莉·麦克琳的之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like "shirley maclaine" before?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.73,0:21:17.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.47,0:21:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很难摆脱这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't shake this feeling like i --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.40,0:21:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉我并不属于这里  你懂我的意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like i don't belong here, you know what i mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.54,0:21:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该做点别的事情  而不是做一个客服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like i should do something more than sit in a cubicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.91,0:21:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想大多数做客服的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think most people who work in
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.56,0:21:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}a cubicle feel  own last name
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:29.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不光这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. well,look, it's more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.45,0:21:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如  我不喜欢我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like -- like i don't like my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.61,0:21:34.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢这个小镇  我不喜欢我的着装\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like this town. i don't like my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.55,0:21:37.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不喜欢自己的姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like my own last name.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.45,0:21:39.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道要怎么解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I -- i don't know how else to explain it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.99,0:21:42.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except that...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.29,0:21:44.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是感觉我应该做点别的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels like i should be doing something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.93,0:21:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我骨子里有些\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's just... something in my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.33,0:21:54.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像我生来就些别的什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like i was destined for something different.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.77,0:21:56.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.41,0:21:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有同感\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever feel that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.51,0:22:03.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不信命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe in destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.15,0:22:05.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do believe in dealing with
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.72,0:22:08.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摆在我们面前的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's right in front of us, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.29,0:22:12.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我们现在干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. so,what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.66,0:22:15.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做我们擅长的  小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do what i do best, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.22,0:22:16.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,研究先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Research.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:18.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:22.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才叫我  小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just call me "Sammy"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.67,0:22:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did i?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.54,0:22:27.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.87,0:22:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.74,0:22:31.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.51,0:22:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.81,0:22:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中头彩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,jackpot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.81,0:22:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找到什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.05,0:22:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找到了世上最好的网页\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just found the best site ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.35,0:22:43.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实中的猎鬼者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real, actual ghost hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.02,0:22:46.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人是天才  先看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}These guys are genius. check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.56,0:22:51.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教学视频吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instructional videos?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.43,0:22:54.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道你观看的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know why you're watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.13,0:22:55.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你遇到了麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事关鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ghost problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.50,0:22:58.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶鬼缠身\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ghost-related problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.13,0:23:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼魂  类似鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-a ghost -- it's like a ghost-adjacent --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.60,0:23:02.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个关乎鬼魂的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like a problem, and the ghost --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.74,0:23:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.51,0:23:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你算来对地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,you've come to the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.54,0:23:08.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,独一无二的好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only decent place, really,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.24,0:23:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为抓鬼特工队知道解决之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the ghostfacers know how to solve it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.51,0:23:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Period.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.31,0:23:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仔细看  认真学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.72,0:23:14.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看好了  跨入超自然之战的第一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}See,the first step in any supernatural fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.65,0:23:17.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄清你在对付的对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figure out what you're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是他  那个鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's him. that's the ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.36,0:23:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,P.t.桑多弗  死于1916年\N{\fnArial\fs30}P.t. sandover -- died 1916.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.77,0:23:31.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕生为其事业而奋斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Devoted his life to his work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.70,0:23:33.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无妻无子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wife,no kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.47,0:23:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾说他就是公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to say he was the company
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.21,0:23:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整栋楼充斥着他的血脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his very blood pumped through the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.41,0:23:42.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠  是个工作狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. okay. so,slight workaholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.34,0:23:43.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许他还在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's still here,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.95,0:23:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看管着公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,watching over the company --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.42,0:23:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至为了它杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even killing for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.88,0:23:50.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  看起来这不是他第一次杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus,turns out this isn't the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.15,0:23:53.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大楼里的人开始自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}People started killing themselves in the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.06,0:23:55.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1929年 大萧条\N{\fnArial\fs30}1929 -- the crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.02,0:23:56.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  很多人从高楼跳下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,but lots of guys jumped off
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.40,0:23:57.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,共有17人自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}of lots of high-es had 17 suicid
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.86,0:24:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪家公司会有17人自杀呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many companies had 17 suicides?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.80,0:24:05.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  P.T.桑多弗  公司的守护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,so,p.t. sandover -- protector of the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.43,0:24:07.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他灵魂苏醒  开始采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}His ghost wakes up and becomes active
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.00,0:24:10.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经济不景气时\N{\fnArial\fs30}During times of grave economic distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.81,0:24:12.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继人们所谈论的大萧条后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,i mean,the worst time we've
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.23,0:24:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又一次危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}seen since the great depression to talk about it
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.41,0:24:14.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是指现在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.58,0:24:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  形势不大好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,now sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.51,0:24:18.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的投资正在缩水\N{\fnArial\fs30}My portfolio's in the sewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.15,0:24:20.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不愿提\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even want to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.62,0:24:23.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢  桑多弗  仍在坚持底线\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Sandover's helping the bottom line...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.99,0:24:25.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通过干掉一些典型员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}By zapping some model employees.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.92,0:24:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我是指  伊恩和保罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. i mean, Hian and paul --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.06,0:24:32.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,貌似他要把他们变成另一种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like he turned them into different people.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.06,0:24:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,勤劳努力的工蜂  正是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect worker bees -- exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.96,0:24:35.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以此来效忠公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}So devoted to the company
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.36,0:24:38.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不成功便成仁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That they would commit hara-kiri if they failed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.87,0:24:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更有趣的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more interesting fact --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.20,0:24:44.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大楼以前没那么高\N{\fnArial\fs30}The building wasn't always that high.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.14,0:24:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有14层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to be 14 floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.11,0:24:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鬼魂袭击的房间号是1444\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the room where the ghost attacked,1444 --
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.41,0:24:53.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很久以前  曾是那老头子的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once upon a time, that was the old man's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.02,0:24:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一看到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you've got that thing in your sights...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.95,0:24:56.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就杀了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.35,0:25:00.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用特制的猎鬼武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Using special ghost-hunting weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.89,0:25:02.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先呢  盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}First,salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.16,0:25:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对鬼魂来说如同强酸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like acid to ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.46,0:25:06.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浓硫酸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burny acid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.00,0:25:08.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是摇头丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not lsd.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.46,0:25:09.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对  是鬼魂的灾难之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. it's a bad trip for ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.80,0:25:11.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来  铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next up -- iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.37,0:25:12.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说扳手会有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why the wrench worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.94,0:25:15.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用尽全力  在一瞬间打散游魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pure power in your hand -- dissipates ghosts instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.14,0:25:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来的小技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next little trick --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.67,0:25:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我们从没用的白痴那里学来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We learned this from those useless douche bags...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.71,0:25:22.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们讨厌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we hate...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.11,0:25:24.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温切斯特家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}...the winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.35,0:25:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-枪  -霰弹枪弹壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gun. - shotgun shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.05,0:25:28.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用盐粒塞满\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pack it up with fresh rock salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.65,0:25:29.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.55,0:25:30.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相当有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}V-very effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.85,0:25:32.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过温切斯特家族依旧很烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchesters still suck ass,though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.96,0:25:34.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Affirmative.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.76,0:25:36.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最主要的是烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suckage -- major.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.53,0:25:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要从哪里弄枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we even get a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.80,0:25:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,枪械店吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gun store?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.40,0:25:45.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从那里弄需要一定时间申请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't there,like,some kind of waiting period or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.70,0:25:47.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我想也是  -那怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think so. - then how in the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.10,0:25:49.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  看起来很不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know,man. it seems pretty impossible,honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.84,0:25:51.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.14,0:25:53.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚提到的超级烦人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The aforementioned super-annoying
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.14,0:25:54.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温切斯特白痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester douche-nozzles
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.88,0:25:57.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还教了些别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also taught us this one other thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.08,0:25:59.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们得火烧遗骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to burn the remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.95,0:26:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  接下来的部分有些恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,this next part gets a little gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.15,0:26:08.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候  你得掘尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes...you might have to...dig up the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.89,0:26:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-抱歉  -在某些州不合法\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. - it's illegal in some states.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.49,0:26:12.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有州\N{\fnArial\fs30}All states.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.60,0:26:14.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能所有州\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly all states.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.86,0:26:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桑多弗被火化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sandover was cremated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.37,0:26:17.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.83,0:26:19.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.24,0:26:21.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果遗体已被火化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,if the deceased has been cremated...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.34,0:26:23.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别慌  -别急\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't panic. - don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.17,0:26:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找找是否有其他遗物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got to look for some other remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.51,0:26:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盒子里的头发  也可能是指甲  乳牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hair in a locket,maybe, fingernails,baby teeth --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.84,0:26:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乳牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milk teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.81,0:26:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遗传物质  知道我们在说什么吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Genetic material. you know what we're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.35,0:26:35.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.28,0:26:37.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好战斗吧  新手们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fight well, young lions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.52,0:26:38.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝福你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godspeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.62,0:26:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你手机调到对讲模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set your cellphone to walkie-talkie
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.26,0:26:44.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防我们被分散\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case we get separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.79,0:26:46.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么可能在一栋摩天大楼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell are we gonna find some ancient speck of dna
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.83,0:26:48.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到八百年前的DNA呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a skyscraper?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.50,0:26:50.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那灵异的储藏室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,that creepy storeroom used
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.09,0:26:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前是桑多弗的办公室吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be sandover's office,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.29,0:27:20.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.83,0:27:24.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么  我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...nothing. i just --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.93,0:27:26.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.91,0:27:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  听我说  我是在这里工作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man,l-listen -- it's okay. I-I work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.91,0:27:37.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别和我说  和警察说去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever. tell it to the cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.00,0:28:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.07,0:28:30.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.20,0:28:31.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次发生这种情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time this happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.53,0:28:33.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们花了两小时才找到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took them two hours to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.80,0:28:35.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就等着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.10,0:29:08.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  我还是等着好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously -- i'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.87,0:29:12.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我不想把时间浪费在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,i don't have the rest of my life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.08,0:29:22.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.36,0:29:35.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等会再打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.99,0:29:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你在吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, are you there
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.37,0:29:44.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在  我想我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. listen,i think i got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.25,0:29:45.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到22楼来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet me on 22.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.65,0:29:47.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.01,0:29:49.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  我要爬楼梯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just,uh... take the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.53,0:30:00.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.70,0:30:03.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,i know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.23,0:30:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.90,0:30:06.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,uh,in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.67,0:30:08.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,P.t.桑多弗的手套\N{\fnArial\fs30}P.t. Sandover's gloves.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.14,0:30:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.30,0:30:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不要打个赌\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much you want to bet there's
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.10,0:30:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看里面是否有一点DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little smidge DNA in there
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.21,0:30:13.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如剪下来的一小片指甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,like a fingernail clipping
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.56,0:30:14.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者头发什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a hair something
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.71,0:30:16.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.38,0:30:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.08,0:30:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.09,0:30:28.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.32,0:30:30.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.82,0:30:56.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干的漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.55,0:30:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.29,0:31:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.29,0:31:07.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.78,0:32:02.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太牛逼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.12,0:32:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.38,0:32:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.63,0:32:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  我得说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man,I got to tell you, I've never
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.09,0:32:14.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没做过这么有意思的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}had so much fun doing in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.36,0:32:15.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.93,0:32:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也是个锻炼啊  是不\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a hell of a workout, too,wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.10,0:32:21.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该继续干这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should keep doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.47,0:32:22.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.67,0:32:23.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.94,0:32:25.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面一定还有其他的鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}There got to be other ghosts out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.91,0:32:27.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以帮助更多的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could help a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.54,0:32:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  就像抓鬼特工队那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,right. we'd be like the ghostfacers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.68,0:32:31.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  来真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,really.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.38,0:32:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说要来真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean...for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.88,0:32:35.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.78,0:32:37.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辞职踏上捉鬼之路吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit our jobs and hit the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.72,0:32:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.29,0:32:41.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们靠什么生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would we live?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.22,0:32:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你搞笑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.79,0:32:46.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道我们通过盗用信用卡过活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would we get by -- with stolen credit cards? huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.13,0:32:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每晚都吃着那些高脂肪的垃圾食品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eating diner food drenched in saturated fats?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.20,0:32:51.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个人每晚都挤在一个汽车旅馆的房间里休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharing a crap motel room every night?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.36,0:32:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那些都只是细枝末节罢了  -事无巨细  都不能忽视\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's all just details. - details are everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.69,0:32:56.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不可能带着一腔热血就开始和鬼灵对抗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to go fighting ghosts without any hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.54,0:33:05.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我还是坦白吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. uh...confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.63,0:33:07.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坦白啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.95,0:33:11.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得我跟你提到过的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember those dreams I told you about,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.85,0:33:12.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于鬼怪的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.82,0:33:14.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.76,0:33:16.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梦里我同他们战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was fighting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.69,0:33:17.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.76,0:33:19.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.49,0:33:23.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们  在梦里  应该就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were... these, like...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.86,0:33:24.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猎鬼者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.93,0:33:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱俩还是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we were friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.34,0:33:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确切地说  就像是两兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like brothers, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.57,0:33:37.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是想说  如果那一切是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what if that's who we really are?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.74,0:33:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想想看我们都在同一个地方  又在一起工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you saw us back there, working together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.82,0:33:42.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而鬼怪有能力搅乱人的思维\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-the ghost was scrambling people's brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.72,0:33:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定也搅乱了我们俩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it scrambled ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.78,0:33:44.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.58,0:33:45.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.69,0:33:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍微想像一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it for just one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.72,0:33:50.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,若是这一切是我们假想中的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we think this is our life...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.19,0:33:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实并不是真的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.39,0:33:55.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  伙计  那个鬼已经灭了  我们还好好地活着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man, the ghost is dead,  and we're still standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.09,0:33:56.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉这么直白  但\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I'm sorry, but --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.16,0:33:58.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  就我所知  这绝对不是我们真正的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, all I know is, this isn't who we're supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.86,0:33:59.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.32,0:34:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确实是迪恩·斯密斯  清楚吗  是市场销售部主管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dean Smith, okay? director of sales and marketing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.78,0:34:04.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕业于斯坦福大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to Stanford.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.81,0:34:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲叫鲍勃  而我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father's name is Bob, my mother's name
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.29,0:34:07.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名叫埃伦  我还有个妹妹  叫乔\N{\fnArial\fs30}is Ellen, and my sis name Jo,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.71,0:34:09.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最后一次和他们聊天是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's the last time you talked to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.41,0:34:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和他们中的任何一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}To any of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.15,0:34:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  你不过是对生活感到沮丧  所以才将梦和现实混淆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. you're upset. you're upset, you're confused --
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.41,0:34:15.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  因为我孤身搬来这个城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, 'cause I only moved here
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.42,0:34:17.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我刚刚和我的未婚妻麦迪森分手\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I just broke up with my fiancee, Madison.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.42,0:34:20.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我打电话给她  电话那头竟是个该死的动物医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I called her number and I got a damn animal hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.40,0:34:23.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你到底在说些什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.29,0:34:26.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是想说  我的家人根本就是虚构的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-you trying to say that -- that my family isn't real?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.26,0:34:29.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的记忆全是捏造出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we've been injected with fake memories?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.64,0:34:30.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.24,0:34:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道  我会有这种想法都是出于我的本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is, I got this feeling in my gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.27,0:34:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我知道  我知道  那是发自内心深处的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know -- I know that, deep down,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.24,0:34:40.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定也有这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be feeling it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.16,0:34:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们肯定有其他身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to be something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.55,0:34:48.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你绝不会就是个酒囊饭袋的小白领\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not just some corporate douche bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.22,0:34:49.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.69,0:34:55.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.12,0:34:58.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.53,0:35:00.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不了解我  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.36,0:35:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.50,0:36:28.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.05,0:36:41.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有空吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.25,0:36:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有  当然有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.09,0:36:46.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉怎么样  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you feeling, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.19,0:36:48.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...great.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.62,0:36:50.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你似乎有点儿疲惫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look a little tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.76,0:36:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做事太拼了吧  我猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been working hard, i gather.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.60,0:36:56.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别谦虚了  我都听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, don't be modest. I hear everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.03,0:36:58.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且非常满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm pleased with what i'm hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.54,0:37:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我此行的重要目的就是让你也高兴一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why it's important to me that you're happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.85,0:37:11.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个数目的奖金满意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that for a bonus?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.92,0:37:16.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真够大笔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.95,0:37:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,纯粹是一己私欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purely selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.25,0:37:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是希望能把你牢牢绑住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to make sure you're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.89,0:37:23.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.19,0:37:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.48,0:37:26.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可是桑多弗梦寐以求的人才啊  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are sandover material, son
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.23,0:37:28.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有抱负  并且清楚未来之路该如何走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real go-getter, carving your own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.33,0:37:29.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你的赞扬  我定努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, thanks. I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.67,0:37:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以预见你将来必成大器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see big things in your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.40,0:37:32.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更甚至于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.64,0:37:36.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以成为东五大湖区分部的高级副总裁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senior v.p., eastern great lakes division.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.04,0:37:39.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会看走眼的  你一定办得到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong. you'll have to work for it
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.44,0:37:41.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然全年无休  餐无定时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven days a week, lunch at your desk
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.91,0:37:46.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但不出十年半载的  你必定会有出头之日\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in 8 to 10 short years, that could be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.32,0:37:52.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,承蒙您看得起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.66,0:37:54.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.02,0:37:55.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's,um...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.49,0:37:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.73,0:38:02.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想正式提出辞呈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am giving my notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.30,0:38:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.30,0:38:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你逗我玩的吧  对不\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.20,0:38:10.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.97,0:38:13.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最近  应该说就在刚才\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recently, uh, very recently
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.24,0:38:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然意识到了还有更重要的事等着我去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Realized that I have some other work I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.68,0:38:19.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那对我而言可以说是举足轻重\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh... very important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.12,0:38:21.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他工作  跳槽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other work? another company?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.45,0:38:23.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  我  很难解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I -- it's hard to explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.46,0:38:28.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that this...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.32,0:38:30.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这  其实就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.50,0:38:35.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的人生不该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}...it's not who I'm supposed to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.84,0:38:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笑什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.14,0:38:43.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  迪恩  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Dean, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.27,0:38:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最终\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.21,0:38:52.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的这究竟是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.25,0:38:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我干嘛打领带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I wearing a tie?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.18,0:38:56.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天  我饿得肝肠寸断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god, am i hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.22,0:38:58.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.42,0:39:00.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢着  我是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. did I
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.53,0:39:04.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才是不是被点化了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did i just get touched by
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.19,0:39:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是天使  对不\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an angel, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.40,0:39:07.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是撒迦利亚(施洗者约翰之父)\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Zachariah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.03,0:39:10.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  真是没完没了  又来一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, great. that's all I need, is another one of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.93,0:39:14.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不是什么又一个  迪恩  我是卡西迪奥的上司\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hardly "another one," Dean. I'm Castiel's superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.17,0:39:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  我根本就没兴趣降尘来此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I had no interest in popping down here
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.64,0:39:18.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更别说  还要附身于这恶心的躯壳里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And into one of these smelly things.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.44,0:39:23.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但在发生了尤利尔那件憾事之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after the unfortunate... situation with Uriel,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.18,0:39:25.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我必须亲自走一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt it necessary to pay a visit
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.26,0:39:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以确保所有人仍各司其职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get my ducks in a row.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.22,0:39:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不是你的玩物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not one of your ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.48,0:39:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意下你的态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting with your attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.22,0:39:35.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是干嘛  搞这么多事就是想给我个当头棒喝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, so, what? this, this was all some sort of a lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.26,0:39:37.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这就是你想告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you're telling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.16,0:39:39.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有创意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, very creative.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.80,0:39:41.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你应该再看看我的其他剪辑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should see my decoupage.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.53,0:39:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我汗毛都竖起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.87,0:39:46.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了  谢谢你的邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.42,0:39:48.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是怎么回事  我刚刚经历的都是幻觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what, I'm... I'm just hallucinating all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.07,0:39:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.31,0:39:51.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不全是  实地  实事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all. real place, real haunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.44,0:39:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唯一费了点儿神的就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just plunked you in the middle
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.24,0:39:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,改造了下你的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without the benefit of your memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.25,0:39:57.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是为了动摇我  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to shake things up? hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.95,0:40:00.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些家伙就这么喜欢看着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you guys can have fun watching us run around
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.28,0:40:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿着猴子装像个小丑似的东奔西跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like ass-clowns in -- in monkey suits?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.22,0:40:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是为了让你正视\N{\fnArial\fs30}To prove to you that the path
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.43,0:40:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你内心真正的自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're on is trul
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.89,0:40:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是个猎鬼者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.50,0:40:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而非你父亲造就了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not because your dad made you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.66,0:40:09.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更非上帝给你赎罪的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not because god called you back from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.93,0:40:12.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是因为你的本性就是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}But because it is what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.33,0:40:13.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你也喜欢这行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.73,0:40:15.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次在你面对黑暗时  你总有法子自寻光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find your way to it in the dark every single time,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.73,0:40:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有这一切  你就会觉得生活苦不堪言\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're miserable without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.00,0:40:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  面对现实吧  你应该是乐于此道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Let's be real here -- you're good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.80,0:40:22.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能成功的  你将阻止一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be successful. you will stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.34,0:40:25.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻止什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.41,0:40:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启吗  路西法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apocalypse, huh? Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.61,0:40:29.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是什么  说明白点儿  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? be specific, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.45,0:40:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命运赋予你的使命  你是无法抗拒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll do everything you're destined to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.71,0:40:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毫无可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.48,0:40:36.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我了解  了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.75,0:40:39.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得自己不够强大  所以退却了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not strong enough. you're scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.22,0:40:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你父亲的事  更让你无法释怀  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got daddy issues. you can't do it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.76,0:40:44.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管你是不是天使  我都要赏你一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel or not, I will stab you in your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.60,0:40:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚所说的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I'm saying is...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.20,0:40:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是你内心真正的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's how you look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.73,0:40:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大多数的人在面对生死抉择的那一刻时根本无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most folks live and die without moving anything more
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.70,0:40:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们只能长眠地下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than the dirt it takes to bury them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.19,0:40:55.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你却会去努力扭转\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get to change things...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.17,0:40:58.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挽救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.17,0:41:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至挽救整个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe even the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.44,0:41:02.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直以来  你都开着那辆经典型车\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the while, you drive a classic car
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.45,0:41:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一路寻花问柳地泡MM\N{\fnArial\fs30}And fornicate with women.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.91,0:41:07.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实那不是亵渎  而是一种恩赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a curse -- it's a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.78,0:41:11.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看在上帝的份上  迪恩  别在自怨自艾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, for god's sakes, Dean, quit whining about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.12,0:41:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看周遭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.06,0:41:19.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命运比你悲惨的人多得去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are plenty of fates worse than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.50,0:41:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂我的意思了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.74,0:41:29.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不要立马去泡杯拿铁给自己果果腹啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go steam yourself another latte?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.84,0:41:33.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许你已经准备好重新振作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are you ready to stand up...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.35,0:41:37.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做回自己呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and be who you really are?
